+ * plus 64 KiB output chunk). This bounded non-owning stack frame is explicitly
+ * outside the heap callback ledger. All Kitty heap storage, including
+ * embedder-PNG-decoder allocations made through the supplied allocator, is
+ * KITTY_IMAGE_CPU.
